@@ -108,7 +108,7 @@
             }
           }
         },
-        "description": "List explored rooms with visible geometry, roof coverage and pawn reachability. A room is not necessarily shelter. Use small pages and inspect complete geometry before choosing a footprint."
+        "description": "Visible rooms ordered by distance to near, with up to cell_limit explored cells nearest that point per room. The outdoors is also a native room; it is not shelter. Use area for local terrain and occupants."
